	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『フルメタル・パニック！ Invisible Victory』11話12話で大活躍した、ウルズチームの漆黒の隊長機「M9Dファルケ」を一部新規金型で立体化！",
			"• 頭部、肩部、脚部パーツは新規金型で造形。新規オリジナル武器も付属。",
			"• M9Dファルケの特徴的な単分子カッター「クリムゾンエッジ」が追加武装として付属。",
			"• 別売りのHG1/60 アーバレストVer.IV（緊急展開ブースター装備仕様）の緊急展開ブースターを装備できる。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Full Metal Panic! Invisible Victory's jet-black captain machine \"M9D Falke\", which played a big role in episodes 11 and 12 of \"Invisible Victory\", is now three-dimensional with some new molds!",
			"• Head, shoulders, and leg parts are molded using new molds. New original weapons are also included.",
			"• M9D Falke's characteristic single molecule cutter \"Crimson Edge\" is included as an additional weapon.",
			"• Can be equipped with the emergency deployment booster of HG1/60 Arbalest Ver.IV (Equipped with emergency deployment booster), which is sold separately."
		]
	},
